        "Content": "Recently renovated Apartment in semi detached bungalow in immaculate condition for rent. 3 minutes drive to Raheen industrial estate and 5 mins drive to university hospital limerick. Comes with 2 en-suite bedrooms, separate office room, separate toilet in corridor, kitchen, dinning room, large utility room and outside patio area. No smoking / vapour and no pets allowed. Suitable for 2 to 3 people."
